{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "8244678",
      "title": "Introducing the Context API",
      "sourceHash": "82dd34748cd9afa371346ab5fb3814e18609bfd329fc7d5354e63447e0747a53",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.69,
          "end": 3.66,
          "en": "So with component composition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.66,
          "end": 6.27,
          "en": "being one possible solution,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.27,
          "end": 10.44,
          "en": "or as mentioned a part of an overall solution,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.44,
          "end": 13.92,
          "en": "let's take a look at the other possible solution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.92,
          "end": 16.44,
          "en": "A solution that can indeed get rid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.44,
          "end": 20.46,
          "en": "of this entire prop drilling problem altogether.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.46,
          "end": 24.64,
          "en": "And that would be React's Context API",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.77,
          "end": 29.61,
          "en": "which is another feature built into React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.61,
          "end": 33.882,
          "en": "And it is a feature that's there to make sharing data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.882,
          "end": 38.882,
          "en": "across Components and across component layers a breeze.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 41.31,
          "end": 46.31,
          "en": "And the idea behind this context feature offered by React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 47.52,
          "end": 51.15,
          "en": "is that you create a context value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 51.15,
          "end": 54.42,
          "en": "and that you then provide that value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 54.42,
          "end": 56.78,
          "en": "that you wrap this context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 56.78,
          "end": 61.05,
          "en": "you could say around multiple Components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 61.05,
          "end": 64.893,
          "en": "possibly around all Components of your app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 65.79,
          "end": 68.16,
          "en": "And I'll of course show you how that works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 68.16,
          "end": 70.443,
          "en": "in practice in the next minutes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 71.46000000000001,
          "end": 75.507,
          "en": "Now, the great thing about this context value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 75.507,
          "end": 79.02,
          "en": "that you provide to multiple Components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 79.02,
          "end": 83.91,
          "en": "is that it can easily be connected to State.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 83.91,
          "end": 87.901,
          "en": "So, you can connect your React state to that context value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 87.901,
          "end": 90.99,
          "en": "which is provided to the entire application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 90.99,
          "end": 95.43,
          "en": "And therefore, you can get rid of all those props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 95.43,
          "end": 97.63300000000001,
          "en": "You don't need to pass the state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 97.63300000000001,
          "end": 100.47,
          "en": "or the state updating functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 100.47,
          "end": 103.53,
          "en": "through multiple component layers anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 103.53,
          "end": 108.33,
          "en": "Instead, since that context value, which is linked to State",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 108.33,
          "end": 112.74000000000001,
          "en": "is provided to all Components in your application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 112.74000000000001,
          "end": 115.92,
          "en": "the Components that do need access,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 115.92,
          "end": 119.72999999999999,
          "en": "that do need to change or read the State",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 119.72999999999999,
          "end": 123.25,
          "en": "can directly reach out to that context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 123.25,
          "end": 126.153,
          "en": "and therefore, also to that State.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 127.62,
          "end": 131.28,
          "en": "And that's therefore a very powerful solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 131.28,
          "end": 135.183,
          "en": "which we'll now explore in practice in greater detail.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}